{"words": [{"text": "يُخَـٰدِعُونَ", "translation": "They seek to deceive"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يَخْدَعُونَ", "translation": "they deceive"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "translation": "they realize (it)"}], "sahih": "They [think to] deceive Allāh and those who believe, but they deceive not except themselves and perceive [it] not."}